{
 "_note": "The sound palette, one entry per cue kind in build.py's cue sheet. A kind is one or more layers, each a Kenney file (\"<pack>/<file>\", CC0: kenney.py fetches the packs and checks each pack's License.txt) or a sound mix.py makes itself from filtered noise (\"synth\": a whoosh or a rise; ours, no licence at all). Per layer: gain (dB, relative to the kind), offset (s after the cue), every (repeat the file at this interval, for the count-up's ticks). Per kind: gain (dB at the mix) and max (seconds; the count-up plays for its own length).",
